 *  Minimal Google API usage: one "Sync Now" (or the optional trigger) = per classroom
 *  CourseWork.list + ONE StudentSubmissions.list(courseId, '-') stream (fields masks), and the
 *  roster (Courses / Teachers / Students lists) only when it is older than
 *  APS_GRADING_ROSTER_REFRESH_HOURS or on request. Upserts keyed on immutable ids, one bulk
 *  setValues per sheet, per-classroom error isolation, time budget with deferral.
 *  Reads: per-classroom CacheService entries keyed by a data generation the sync bumps.
 *
 *  RBAC (server-side: rosterUserContext_ / gradingScope_ / rosterCanSync_ — UI visibility is
 *  not authorization): EVERY role (Admin, HM, BOD, Teacher, Student) sees only the classrooms it
 *  is assigned to (ACTIVE teacher or student there; APS_GRADING_ALL_CLASSES_ROLES can widen
