/* --------------------------- GRADES (Classroom "Grades" tab) --------------------------- */
/*
 * Everything the Google Classroom "Grades" tab shows, for APPROVED assignments only (gradesCategory_:
 * ATT_ / HW_ / QUZ_ / TRMST / MODEL_EXAM / EXAM prefixes): per student and assignment the mark, max points,
 * GRADED / UNGRADED, submission status (Assigned / Turned in / Late / Returned / Missing /
 * Reclaimed / Draft grade), assigned / due / turn-in / graded / returned dates.
 *
 * Minimal Google API usage per classroom (and per run):
 *   1. CourseWork.list (PUBLISHED only, fields mask) — usually 1 call.
 *   2. StudentSubmissions.list(courseId, '-') — ALL submissions of the classroom in one paginated
 *      stream (never one call per assignment), fields mask; skipped when the classroom has no
 *      approved assignment.
 * Students are matched by Google user id against the roster sheets (no profile lookups). The
 * course list comes from the roster, and the roster itself is only refreshed when it is older
 * than APS_GRADING_ROSTER_REFRESH_HOURS (default 12) or on request.
