/** "🟢 Available to Take Classes • <name> • MM/DD HH:mm:ss ET • Confirm - I'm Available" / "⚪ Not Set" / "🟡 Not Available to Take Classes • Admin · info • 10/01 16:10:32 ET • Parent-Teacher Arranged". */
