/**
 * Rebuilds Class_Access_Map after a sync — one row per email + course (named PRIMARY_TEACHER / VP / HM and every other
 * Classroom TEACHER) — and audits every change: COURSE_ACCESS_MAPPING_CREATED / _UPDATED, CLASS_ACCESS_GRANTED /
 * _REMOVED / _ALREADY_EXISTS / _DENIED. One sheet read + one write; an unchanged sync writes no audit row.
