/* ===================== END CLASS SUPPORT (VP / HM) — ROLE-BASED CLASS ACCESS ===================== */

/* ============================== CLASS MEET LINKS (Classes tab) ============================== */
/**
 * Google Meet link for every class card (shown next to "Join to WhatsApp" and the Classroom icon, with a Copy button,
 * to every role that can see the class). The Classroom API does not return a course's Meet link, so it is resolved,
 * at request time, in this order:
 *   1. ADMIN_MAPPED   — Attendance > Course-Meet Link mapping (sheet Course_Meet_Link_Map), set by Admin / HM;
 *   2. CLASSROOM      — a meet.google.com link written in the class's Classroom Description / Room / Section / heading;
 *   3. AUTO_DETECTED  — the Meet the class actually used, remembered by the Attendance sync from the Meet audit log
 *                       (teacher's Meet, otherwise the Meet most of the class joined) — sheet Course_Meet_Link_Detected.
 * Only a well-formed https://meet.google.com/xxx-xxxx-xxx link is ever shown. Read once per 10 minutes (CacheService).
