/**
 * r42 — "Not in the list" manual entry (Teacher / Admin / Super Admin / Head Master, per request): the sender
 * types the name and the recipient's email. Guard rails: the email must be an APS-domain address
 * (isApsEmailAllowed_ — no outside addresses), admin@ is always CC'd, and the audit row is marked MANUAL with
 * the sender and role. The optional courseId is recorded only if it is one of the sender's own classes.
