/* ==========================================================================
 *  r101 — WEEKLY CLASS CONSOLIDATION ANALYSIS (AY26-27) — analysis + email only
 *  Every Wednesday (America/New_York; DST handled by the trigger time zone):
 *    ~7:00 PM  apsClassConsolidationAnalysis — reads the synced course cache (readAllCoursesFromCache_:
