 *              plus the fixed recipients (Script Property CLASS_CONSOLIDATION_FIXED_RECIPIENTS).
 *  Rules: same Nilai + same day + same start + same end; ≤7 combined = HIGH, 8 = MEDIUM (review), >8 never;
 *  each class in at most one merge (per slot: most classes removed, then most exact-7 results, then fewest 8s);
 *  different time = LOW / explore only. NOTHING is ever changed in Classroom, rosters, teachers or schedules.
 *  Zoho (§21): neutral — read-only, keyed by Course ID + teacher email.
 * ========================================================================== */
