/* ---------- r106: next-morning schedule + automatic catch-up ----------
 * ~6:00 AM  apsDailySummaryPrep    — the existing attendance capture for YESTERDAY's classes (only if yesterday had a class).
 * ~7:00 AM  apsDailySummaryReport  — the daily report for yesterday + any missed class day in the last DS_LOOKBACK_DAYS_.
 * ~8:00 AM  apsMonthlySummaryReport — the previous month's report (on the 1st; later mornings catch up a missed one).
 * The report run never runs the attendance sync itself (r105 could hit the 6-minute limit). What is "missing" is read
 * from the Daily / Monthly Summary sheet, so a run that was cut off or failed is simply picked up the next morning —
