/* ==========================================================================
 * r107 — Continuous Student Absence Monitoring (more than 4 consecutive class weeks) + emails.
 *  Weekly, Wednesday ~9:30 AM America/New_York (after the weekend is captured on Monday and teachers'
 *  overrides are in): one run evaluates every student of the active AY26-27 classes from the EXISTING
 *  attendance week sheets (AWKnnATT — one bulk read), course cache, Class Support (HM / VP), Class Coverage
 *  Tracking and Apply Leave. No Classroom / Meet API call.
