 *  Consecutive absence (per student, by class WEEK, newest first):
 *   - a class session counts only if it was CONDUCTED: at least one person (teacher or student) of that class
 *     joined on that date (so holidays / classes nobody held are ignored) and it is not CLASS_CANCELLED in
