 *   - a week = ATTENDED if any session that week is PRESENT / PARTIAL (override wins), EXCUSED weeks (approved
 *     leave / teacher override) are skipped — they neither count nor break the run — otherwise ABSENT;
 *   - the run of ABSENT weeks back from the latest counted week = Consecutive Weeks Absent; qualifies when it
