 *  run). Student email SENT is never resent; FAILED / PENDING is retried on the next run (or runStudentAbsenceNow).
 *  The admin report lists every qualifying student not yet in a SENT admin report (a failed admin report is
 *  therefore retried automatically) plus, for context, those still absent from earlier reports. No new student
