 *  the monthly email in a run does not also get that run's weekly email (its highlights are included).
 *  Idempotent: TEACHER_APPRECIATION_EMAIL_LOG keyed TYPE|period|email; a SENT row is never sent again; a CacheService
 *  claim stops two runs sending the same email; FAILED rows retry (max 3 automatic attempts) on the continuation /
